 '\nEvery shot shows a short white slogan with the product line (for example "' + productLine(k.frames[0].dish) + '") below it in the accent colour; the closing card shows a question and a short call to action.\n' +
 'Write THREE CLEARLY DIFFERENT alternatives. In each alternative:\n' +
 '- lines: one slogan per dish, in shot order (' + n + ' in total). Each at most ' + LW + ' words and ' + LC + ' characters, a complete, natural phrase about the texture or cooking of that dish as visible in the photo, WITHOUT the dish name, no trailing period. The first slogan must be a strong opener that stops the scroll.\n' +
